{"data":{"body":"**P3 \u2014 Preserve the existing constructor's `initCause` behavior.** Delegating with a null cause invokes `Throwable(message, null)`, which marks the cause initialized; callers that previously attached a cause with `initCause` will now receive `IllegalStateException`. Keep the two-argument constructor calling `super(message)` and assigning its fields directly, while retaining the new overload for explicit causes.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc772RLe","finding_digest":"b29aa57998104354b30fbb1d0da75bf9dfb2a76dd9f670ecd0e8a723089ada88","finding_id":"arf_v1_wknkk6mycbbvjmypxmoq3j237h","finding_key":"sdk/exception/unrecoverabledurableexecutionexception::two-argument-constructor::init-cause-compatibility","identity_key":"sdk/exception/unrecoverabledurableexecutionexception::two-argument-constructor::init-cause-compatibility","line":13,"observation_digest":"f5258fbd10fcd032cef933478a0561d1f7a4ffb2935cd56ba325e772f28f0520","observation_id":"aro_v1_6usy7piq7tidftxzgndyublb2h","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/exception/UnrecoverableDurableExecutionException.java","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-10-08T23:52:43Z","review_id":"arr_v1_szk72x3mjnb5bveole7xlq3ka3","reviewed_base_sha":"0c8618e42d3b16e9b7115ab943a93253c0fe936c","reviewed_head_sha":"a14e96e22281887b621451a5488a88d7de1a49ff","reviewer":"codex","start_line":13,"suggestion_id":"arsg_v1_adrn3shqjramd2b6mkhtpoctpj"},"pull_request":{"number":769},"record_id":"art_v1_fhmhqpch4it57exqvz6cbjbxas","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-08T23:52:43Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
